WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.750
Open Renewals in your account.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:18.550
Here you can see what's overdue, and what renews in the next 30 and 90 days.

3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.750
Tick the services and domains you want to renew.

4
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.950
Click Renew in the bar at the bottom.

5
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:33.440
Then pay for everything you ticked, on one invoice.
